---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Staying in Europe — Case Study" description="Schengen visa calculator for British citizens">
  <section class="hero-case">
    <a href="/work" class="back-link">← Work</a>
    <div class="case-tenets">
      <span class="tenet">Clarity</span>
      <span class="tenet">AI</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Staying in Europe</h1>
    <p class="case-tagline">The simplest Schengen calculator for British citizens</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Problem</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <p>
        Post-Brexit, British citizens can only spend 90 days in the Schengen zone 
        within any 180-day rolling window. Sounds simple. It isn't.
      </p>
      <p>
        Try calculating it yourself: "I spent 14 days in Spain in March, 8 days in 
        France in May, and now it's August — how many days do I have left?" The 
        rolling window makes this genuinely confusing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Existing calculators were clunky, ugly, or demanded too much input. British 
        expats and frequent travellers needed something simple that just works.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Approach</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <h3>1. Ruthless Simplicity</h3>
      <p>One purpose. No feature creep. Enter your trips, see your remaining days. That's it.</p>
      
      <h3>2. Mobile-First Design</h3>
      <p>You're checking this at the airport, in a café abroad, on your phone. It has to work perfectly there.</p>
      
      <h3>3. Visual Clarity</h3>
      <p>The 180-day window visualised so you can actually understand what's happening. Not just a number — a picture.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Build</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>React app</strong> — Fast, responsive, works offline</li>
        <li><strong>Local storage</strong> — Your trips saved on your device</li>
        <li><strong>Rolling window logic</strong> — The hard bit, handled for you</li>
        <li><strong>Clean UI</strong> — Inter font, minimal design, zero friction</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Outcome</h2>
    <div class="case-outcome">
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">Live</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">in production</span>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">1</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">job, done well</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="outcome-text">A tool that solves one problem completely. No account needed, no upsell, just utility.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Visit</h2>
    <div class="demo-box">
      <a href="https://www.stayingineurope.com/" target="_blank" class="cta-button">stayingineurope.com ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section related-section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Related Content</h2>
    <div class="related-items">
      <a href="/insights" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">📝</span>
        <div>
          <strong>42 years to build my first app</strong>
          <span>My journey from journalist to builder</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/clarity" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">→</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Clarity Tenet</strong>
          <span>Making complex things simple</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Got a problem that needs a simple solution?</h2>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Let's Talk</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-case {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-tenets {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .tenet {
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  
  .hero-case h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-tagline {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  
  .case-content {
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  
  .case-content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .case-content ul {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .case-content strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-outcome {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .outcome-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .outcome-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  
  .outcome-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .outcome-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  
  .demo-box {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .related-section {
    border-top: none;
  }
  
  .related-items {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .related-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  
  .related-link:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .related-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .related-link strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .related-link span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>
